  "longBusinessSummary": "ad pepper media International N.V. provides performance marketing services in Germany, the United Kingdom, Spain, the Netherlands, and internationally. It operates through three segments: ad pepper, solute, and Webgains. The ad pepper segment operates iLead, a lead generation platform that helps in the acquisition of customer data without advertising risk; iSense, a targeting platform, which helps in delivering the right message to the right person in the right place at the right time; and Mailpepper, an email marketing platform, as well as provides performance display online advertising solution. The solute segment offers digital commerce and price comparison solution. The Webgains segment provides affiliate marketing solutions. The company was founded in 1999 and is headquartered in Nuremberg, Germany.",
